    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·10月更新内容前瞻</strong></span></span></span></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"dc8f6fd96c4db06811e427ba8b50946d\" title=\"10月前瞻.png\" alt=\"10月前瞻.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20240718/dc8f6fd96c4db06811e427ba8b50946d.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·讲述者列表</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"4eaf0851e9e0f3482b5492f22922dd5b\" title=\"10月月小队.png\" alt=\"10月月小队.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20240718/4eaf0851e9e0f3482b5492f22922dd5b.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>奇遇讲述者魔王</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在年代的尽头，她决定将一段独一无二的诗占为己有。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·假说辑录</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"74650eb1d9d48df21743aaa48ec0a155\" title=\"10月奖励.png\" alt=\"10月奖励.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20240718/74650eb1d9d48df21743aaa48ec0a155.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">假说辑录添加内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">假说辑录的等级上限提升至</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">95</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">10月稀有奖励锡人形象时装</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">摒弃理性的形象。才是灵魂真正的面貌。尊崇内心吧。以混沌性感诠释时尚。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·本月委托栏</strong></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">本月委托栏将会覆盖一批委托。委托更新后，上月的委托进度将不会被继承。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">您将获得可在本月使用的四次刷新未完成委托的机会。点击刷新后，即可重新获得同等级的委托。</span></span></span></p>",
